1
00:00:44,350 --> 00:00:45,380
[Unsoiled Starlight]

2
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:47,050
[Episode 9]

3
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:47,450
[Adapted from Migu's novel
"Unsoiled Starlight"]

4
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:47,950
[Original Writer: Shan Gu Jun]

5
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:49,360
Lanlan.

6
00:00:50,570 --> 00:00:51,900
Don't you recognize me?

7
00:00:57,200 --> 00:00:58,280
Mr. Xu.

8
00:01:01,670 --> 00:01:02,680
Why don't we

9
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,690
sit down to talk?

10
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,480
Okay.

11
00:01:08,480 --> 00:01:09,160
Lanlan.

12
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,160
You really forgot.

13
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:13,289
When you were little...

14
00:01:13,640 --> 00:01:14,870
when you were little like this,

15
00:01:14,870 --> 00:01:16,870
your dad brought you to the company.

16
00:01:17,400 --> 00:01:19,000
I even held you in my arms.

17
00:01:19,160 --> 00:01:20,360
You didn't even know.

18
00:01:22,080 --> 00:01:23,810
Why are you sitting so far away?

19
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:26,320
Sit here.

20
00:01:27,310 --> 00:01:28,120
No, thanks.

21
00:01:28,870 --> 00:01:30,160
I'm fine sitting here.

22
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:32,960
Still so stubborn.

23
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:34,600
But you...

24
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:36,600
you've really changed.

25
00:01:38,700 --> 00:01:40,900
You're getting prettier and prettier.

26
00:01:41,390 --> 00:01:43,190
I heard from the factory manager

27
00:01:43,530 --> 00:01:45,130
that you were looking for me.

28
00:01:47,270 --> 00:01:49,930
I've heard about
what's going on at the factory.

29
00:01:50,039 --> 00:01:51,560
As for Qining,

30
00:01:52,090 --> 00:01:53,920
I have some pull there.

31
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:54,840
Lanlan,

32
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:56,680
if you need my help,

33
00:01:57,170 --> 00:01:58,280
I will

34
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,960
definitely spare no effort to help you.

35
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,160
How is it?

36
00:02:05,140 --> 00:02:05,920
What are you doing?

37
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,650
Give it to me!

38
00:02:06,710 --> 00:02:07,680
Give it to me!

39
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:14,040
I never thought

40
00:02:14,490 --> 00:02:15,900
that Shu Minghai's daughter

41
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:17,700
would come begging to me one day.

42
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:28,480
Seeing you up close like this,

43
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:29,140
I have to say

44
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:32,100
you're just as beautiful as your mother.

45
00:02:33,690 --> 00:02:34,800
Fight back again,

46
00:02:34,840 --> 00:02:36,100
and I'll strangle you!

47
00:02:43,470 --> 00:02:44,600
Go ahead! I dare you!

48
00:02:44,730 --> 00:02:45,860
Go ahead! I dare you!

49
00:02:56,710 --> 00:02:57,360
I dare you!

50
00:02:58,040 --> 00:02:58,600
I...

51
00:02:59,240 --> 00:02:59,770
Who is it?

52
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:11,380
Enough.

53
00:03:12,010 --> 00:03:12,600
Enough!

54
00:03:12,770 --> 00:03:13,640
Stop fighting!

55
00:03:17,130 --> 00:03:18,530
Don't make things worse.

56
00:03:19,700 --> 00:03:21,030
For this kind of person,

57
00:03:21,130 --> 00:03:22,130
it's not worth it.

58
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,680
It's okay now.

59
00:03:37,320 --> 00:03:38,250
Call the police!

60
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,780
Come, tell me what happened.

61
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:40,640
What else is there to say?

62
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,320
Officer,

63
00:03:41,490 --> 00:03:43,800
look at my injuries. They're so severe.

64
00:03:43,950 --> 00:03:45,600
He almost crippled me!

65
00:03:45,670 --> 00:03:46,920
I want to sue him!

66
00:03:47,070 --> 00:03:47,960
Don't worry.

67
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:48,880
We will investigate thoroughly.

68
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:49,820
You better investigate properly!

69
00:03:49,820 --> 00:03:50,760
Officer,

70
00:03:50,880 --> 00:03:52,840
Xu Tao attempted to rape me.

71
00:03:52,860 --> 00:03:54,320
We were just acting in self-defense.

72
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,400
Don't talk nonsense!

73
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,600
Did you take your pants off?

74
00:03:56,600 --> 00:03:58,130
Wh-When did I ever rape you?

75
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,100
Wh-What are you doing?

76
00:04:00,320 --> 00:04:02,520
I want to request an injury assessment.

77
00:04:04,800 --> 00:04:05,440
Th-this...

78
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:06,550
It's not that serious.

79
00:04:06,550 --> 00:04:07,160
She did it to herself.

80
00:04:07,160 --> 00:04:09,280
- Stop arguing.
- Zhang.

81
00:04:09,600 --> 00:04:10,960
Take him over there to make a statement.

82
00:04:10,960 --> 00:04:11,290
Okay.

83
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,250
Come with me.

84
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:13,200
You just wait!

85
00:04:13,480 --> 00:04:14,940
I'll make you pay for this!

86
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,400
Can I make a phone call first?

87
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:37,560
Mr. Zhuo.

88
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:39,640
I'm sorry.

89
00:04:39,760 --> 00:04:40,760
Is your hand okay?

90
00:04:41,540 --> 00:04:42,200
Lanlan.

91
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:43,760
No.

92
00:04:43,850 --> 00:04:44,920
What I mean is...

93
00:04:45,159 --> 00:04:45,800
I mean

94
00:04:46,440 --> 00:04:47,770
just treat me like a fart

95
00:04:48,280 --> 00:04:49,010
and let me go.

96
00:04:49,040 --> 00:04:49,640
That's it.

97
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,740
That's what I mean.

98
00:04:51,440 --> 00:04:51,800
Also,

99
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:52,490
Officer,

100
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,300
I want to

101
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,440
withdraw the police report.

102
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,170
Withdraw it.

103
00:04:55,520 --> 00:04:56,440
I hurt myself.

104
00:04:56,880 --> 00:04:57,880
I did it to myself.

105
00:04:58,050 --> 00:04:59,080
Officer,

106
00:04:59,360 --> 00:05:00,420
can we leave first?

107
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,160
Yes.

108
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:28,080
Why did you suddenly show up?

109
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,500
Of course I was worried about you.

110
00:05:31,440 --> 00:05:32,080
If I hadn't asked

111
00:05:32,080 --> 00:05:33,880
the factory secretary where you went...

112
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:37,280
Otherwise, I really can't imagine
what would have happened.

113
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:54,640
Thank you.

114
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,040
By the way,

115
00:06:09,980 --> 00:06:10,750
is your hand

116
00:06:11,030 --> 00:06:11,720
okay?

117
00:06:13,080 --> 00:06:13,680
It's fine.

118
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,480
Can you take me to the airport later?

119
00:06:20,960 --> 00:06:22,240
I have a flight

120
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:23,400
back to Senzhou tonight.

121
00:06:23,400 --> 00:06:24,160
Shu Tinglan,

122
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:26,620
at a time like this,

123
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:29,800
can you stop thinking about
working overtime?

124
00:06:34,860 --> 00:06:37,060
We both happen to be in Qining right now.

125
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:38,920
Since my hand is injured,

126
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:42,730
do you want to stay with me
for a couple of days?

127
00:06:44,570 --> 00:06:45,159
Okay.

128
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:55,720
Hello.

129
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,250
Whatever you do,

130
00:06:57,380 --> 00:06:59,159
I can turn a blind eye to it.

131
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:02,450
But you shouldn't abuse your connections
back home.

132
00:07:03,050 --> 00:07:03,520
Okay.

133
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:06,360
Whether you did anything wrong or not,

134
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:07,560
you're asking for a favor

135
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,370
using someone else's connections.

136
00:07:09,370 --> 00:07:12,000
Do you know how much
gossip
it will cause for them and yourself?

137
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:13,260
It won't happen again.

138
00:07:19,060 --> 00:07:20,840
Did I cause trouble for you?

139
00:07:22,760 --> 00:07:23,320
No.

140
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,120
Tomorrow,

141
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,640
I'll take you out.

142
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:35,070
Okay.

143
00:07:35,190 --> 00:07:35,680
Okay.

144
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:50,820
I just remembered that

145
00:07:50,820 --> 00:07:53,680
Zhuoyuan Tech's new product launch
is next Monday.

146
00:07:53,970 --> 00:07:56,500
How are you still in the mood
to wander around?

147
00:07:56,830 --> 00:08:00,480
I'll wait for you in the crowd

148
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,850
An injured person needs an excuse to rest.

149
00:08:01,550 --> 00:08:07,370
We're in sync. Unbelievable.

150
00:08:03,160 --> 00:08:04,130
For the new product launch,

151
00:08:04,130 --> 00:08:06,030
remember to come
and check it out if you have time.

152
00:08:06,030 --> 00:08:06,590
Okay.

153
00:08:08,490 --> 00:08:13,040
♪ It's the cloak of a close embrace ♪

154
00:08:13,550 --> 00:08:19,020
♪ It's the steadfast days and
nights we share ♪

155
00:08:14,280 --> 00:08:15,240
Wait for me here.

156
00:08:20,150 --> 00:08:25,310
♪ When we weather the storm together,
don't forget ♪

157
00:08:25,990 --> 00:08:30,530
♪ Breathing in the long river of time ♪

158
00:08:31,180 --> 00:08:36,659
♪ My only promise is to you ♪

159
00:08:32,400 --> 00:08:33,730
Where did you get a bike?

160
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,120
Get on.

161
00:08:38,890 --> 00:08:41,549
♪ Between us ♪

162
00:08:41,789 --> 00:08:44,700
♪ Suspicion feels so far away ♪

163
00:08:45,140 --> 00:08:50,560
♪ When our eyes meet,
I feel your burning gaze ♪

164
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:54,060
♪ The wind by the shore has stilled ♪

165
00:08:54,370 --> 00:08:56,880
♪ And you're smiling too ♪

166
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:59,670
♪ Make a wish to the wind ♪

167
00:09:00,070 --> 00:09:05,200
♪ It's Cupid's arrow,
set loose from the string ♪

168
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:07,760
We'll be late if we don't ride faster,

169
00:09:07,760 --> 00:09:08,320
kiddo.

170
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:09,480
Uncle.

171
00:09:09,610 --> 00:09:10,520
What's the rush?

172
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:11,760
Why are you riding so fast?

173
00:09:11,760 --> 00:09:12,720
Uncle?

174
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:14,690
Call me brother.

175
00:09:15,910 --> 00:09:19,610
♪ Waiting for you in the crowd ♪

176
00:09:20,630 --> 00:09:25,850
♪ Hearts in sync—how incredible ♪

177
00:09:27,570 --> 00:09:32,360
♪ It's the familiar breath we share ♪

178
00:09:31,760 --> 00:09:33,160
I just made an appointment
with the teacher.

179
00:09:32,610 --> 00:09:37,900
♪ It's being each other's exception ♪

180
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,880
Let's go back to school together
and take a look.

181
00:09:34,880 --> 00:09:37,540
They won't keep us out
for being late, will they?

182
00:09:37,790 --> 00:09:39,960
If they do, I guess we'll have to stand there
and wait for a teacher to come get us.

183
00:09:39,230 --> 00:09:44,590
♪ When tides ebb and flow, I look to you ♪

184
00:09:45,070 --> 00:09:49,800
♪ Drowning in the long river of time ♪

185
00:09:46,290 --> 00:09:47,820
[Qining City High School]

186
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:55,140
[Qining High School]

187
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:56,570
♪ You're the only air I breathe ♪

188
00:09:57,980 --> 00:10:00,280
♪ Between us ♪

189
00:10:00,830 --> 00:10:03,740
♪ The image of us holding each other ♪

190
00:10:04,230 --> 00:10:07,770
♪ I see the dream encounter of that day ♪

191
00:10:07,900 --> 00:10:10,280
Remember this was our class.

192
00:10:10,520 --> 00:10:12,450
A bit further ahead was your class.

193
00:10:12,850 --> 00:10:15,320
And right around the corner
was the math classroom.

194
00:10:15,320 --> 00:10:16,780
How is your memory so good?

195
00:10:17,010 --> 00:10:18,470
I can't remember clearly.

196
00:10:19,560 --> 00:10:20,360
Shu Tinglan.

197
00:10:20,710 --> 00:10:21,160
Yeah?

198
00:10:23,610 --> 00:10:24,870
I remember everything

199
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:26,520
about you.

200
00:10:31,280 --> 00:10:32,360
Do you remember

201
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,520
that one time you were
at the classroom door,

202
00:10:34,520 --> 00:10:36,450
holding a workbook and calling me?

203
00:10:36,560 --> 00:10:37,690
What did you call me?

204
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:43,440
Excuse me, is Zhuo Yuan here?

205
00:10:45,560 --> 00:10:46,600
Zhuo Yuan?

206
00:10:47,200 --> 00:10:48,200
Is Zhuo Yuan here?

207
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:55,920
Hey,

208
00:10:56,920 --> 00:10:57,780
I'm right here.

209
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:00,560
Zhuo Yuan.

210
00:11:00,910 --> 00:11:02,360
I found your workbook.

211
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:04,320
Read after me.

212
00:11:04,680 --> 00:11:07,680
My name is Zhuo Yu'an.

213
00:11:05,660 --> 00:11:07,980
[Zhuo Yu'an]

214
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:15,680
I don't remember.

215
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,560
Heartless.

216
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:42,480
Come on, pass it to me.

217
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:53,980
- Come on.
- Come on.

218
00:11:55,160 --> 00:11:56,440
After all these years,

219
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,520
the school hasn't changed much.

220
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:02,850
It really hasn't changed much.

221
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,680
Come on, pass it to me.

222
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,320
I didn't expect

223
00:12:20,630 --> 00:12:22,400
this noodle shop is still here.

224
00:12:39,680 --> 00:12:41,600
I used to come here every day back then.

225
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:42,930
I would sit right there.

226
00:12:56,800 --> 00:12:57,360
I know.

227
00:13:01,550 --> 00:13:02,720
Because I sat right there.
